{"format":"atelier-package","version":1,"name":"User story map","generator":"Atelier template library","boards":[{"id":"userstories-b1","name":"User story map","parent":null,"description":"Capture user needs as stories along the user journey, sliced into releases, so the team builds the smallest thing that works end to end.","color":"theme","cards":[{"id":"userstories-c2","type":"heading","x":40,"y":40,"w":1180,"h":67,"title":"Story map — Porch MVP","body":"The journey across the top; stories under each step; releases as horizontal slices.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c3","type":"sticky","x":1260,"y":40,"w":380,"h":200,"title":"How to use this template","body":"Write stories as “As a…, I want…, so that…”. The top slice must let someone complete the whole journey, however basic. Move stories down to later releases freely.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c4","type":"note","x":40,"y":280,"w":320,"h":78,"title":"Find an item","body":"","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c5","type":"note","x":380,"y":280,"w":320,"h":78,"title":"Request it","body":"","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c6","type":"note","x":720,"y":280,"w":320,"h":78,"title":"Hand over","body":"","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c7","type":"note","x":1060,"y":280,"w":320,"h":78,"title":"Use & return","body":"","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"userstories-c8","type":"note","x":1400,"y":280,"w":320,"h":78,"title":"Rate","body":"","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"